sequenceDiagram
    %% Flow 1: Online Feature Retrieval
    rect rgb(230, 245, 255)
    Note over Client,RegistryBackend: Flow 1: Online Feature Retrieval
    participant Client as ML Inference Client
    participant OnlineSvc as feast-{name}-online<br/>80/TCP (HTTP) or 443/TCP (HTTPS)
    participant SecurityMgr as SecurityManager<br/>OIDC / K8s Auth
    participant OnlineStore as Online Store Backend<br/>(Redis/Postgres/DynamoDB)
    participant Registry as Registry<br/>(SQL/Snowflake)

    Client->>OnlineSvc: POST /get-online-features<br/>Bearer Token (OIDC/K8s)
    OnlineSvc->>SecurityMgr: Validate token & check<br/>READ_ONLINE permission
    SecurityMgr-->>OnlineSvc: Authorized
    OnlineSvc->>Registry: Fetch feature metadata<br/>TLS (configurable)
    Registry-->>OnlineSvc: Feature definitions
    OnlineSvc->>OnlineStore: Read feature values<br/>Credentials via Secret
    OnlineStore-->>OnlineSvc: Feature values
    OnlineSvc-->>Client: JSON/Protobuf Response<br/>TLS (configurable)
    end

    %% Flow 2: Feature Materialization
    rect rgb(255, 245, 230)
    Note over CronJob,OnlineStoreMat: Flow 2: Feature Materialization
    participant CronJob as CronJob / API Call
    participant MatSvc as feast-{name}-online<br/>80/TCP or 443/TCP
    participant OfflineStore as Offline Store Backend<br/>(Snowflake/BigQuery/Postgres)
    participant OnlineStoreMat as Online Store Backend

    CronJob->>MatSvc: POST /materialize<br/>Bearer Token
    MatSvc->>OfflineStore: Read historical features<br/>Credentials via Secret
    OfflineStore-->>MatSvc: Historical feature data
    MatSvc->>OnlineStoreMat: Write materialized features<br/>Credentials via Secret
    OnlineStoreMat-->>MatSvc: Write confirmed
    MatSvc-->>CronJob: Materialization complete
    end

    %% Flow 3: Operator Reconciliation
    rect rgb(230, 255, 230)
    Note over FSChange,K8sRBAC: Flow 3: Operator Reconciliation
    participant FSChange as FeatureStore CR Change
    participant Operator as feast-operator<br/>Controller
    participant K8sAPI as Kubernetes API<br/>443/TCP HTTPS
    participant RegistryREST as feast-{name}-registry-rest<br/>6572/TCP or 6573/TCP
    participant K8sRBAC as Kubernetes RBAC API<br/>443/TCP HTTPS

    FSChange->>Operator: Watch event triggers reconcile
    Operator->>K8sAPI: Create/Update Deployments,<br/>Services, ConfigMaps, RBAC<br/>ServiceAccount token
    K8sAPI-->>Operator: Resources reconciled
    Operator->>RegistryREST: GET /api/v1/permissions<br/>Intra-comm JWT
    RegistryREST-->>Operator: Permission policies
    Operator->>K8sRBAC: Create Roles & RoleBindings<br/>from Feast permissions
    K8sRBAC-->>Operator: RBAC resources created
    end

    %% Flow 4: Notebook ConfigMap Injection
    rect rgb(245, 230, 255)
    Note over NotebookCR,ConfigMap: Flow 4: Notebook ConfigMap Injection
    participant NotebookCR as Notebook CR<br/>(opendatahub.io/feast-integration label)
    participant NBController as NotebookConfigMap<br/>Controller
    participant FSCR as FeatureStore CR
    participant ConfigMap as ConfigMap<br/>{notebook-name}-feast-config

    NotebookCR->>NBController: Watch event<br/>(labeled Notebook)
    NBController->>FSCR: Read feast project annotation
    FSCR-->>NBController: FeatureStore config
    NBController->>ConfigMap: Create ConfigMap<br/>with Feast client config
    end
